{"ticker":"NDAQ","updated":"2026-11-14T01:15:58Z","profile":{"longName":"Nasdaq, Inc.","shortName":"Nasdaq, Inc.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Financial Data & Stock Exchanges","country":"United States","website":"https://www.nasdaq.com","fullTimeEmployees":9593,"marketCap":60196810752,"trailingPE":29.636612,"forwardPE":22.846804,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":10.414674,"pegRatio":1.68,"targetMeanPrice":115.375,"targetHighPrice":135.0,"targetLowPrice":87.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":16,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.126,"earningsGrowth":0.315,"grossMargins":1.0,"operatingMargins":0.48962003,"profitMargins":0.36055002,"totalRevenue":5779999744,"beta":0.957,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":111.45,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":76.55,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.07},"summary":"Nasdaq, Inc. operates as a technology company that serves capital markets and other industries in the United States and internationally. It operates through three segments: Capital Access Platforms, Financial Technology, and Market Services. The company distributes historical and real-time market data; develops and licenses Nasdaq-branded indices and financial products; provides investor relations intelligence, governance solutions, and sustainability solution products for public and private companies, and organizations, as well as insights and workflow solutions; and operates listing platforms. It also offers Verafin, a cloud-based platform to detect, investigate, and report money laundering and financial frauds; AxiomSL, a risk data management and regulatory reporting solution; cloud-enabled and on-premises surveillance solutions to assist in complying with market rules, regulations, and internal market surveillance policies; Calypso, a platform providing cross-asset, front-to-back trading, treasury, risk, and collateral management solutions; and trade management and colocation services, as well as handles assets comprising cash equities, equity derivatives, currencies, various interest-bearing securities, commodities, energy products, and digital currencies. In addition, the company provides equity derivative trading and clearing, cash equity trading and fixed income, curren","summary_zh":"納斯達克公司是一家科技公司，為美國和國際資本市場和其他行業提供服務。它透過三個部門運作：資本准入平台、金融科技和市場服務。公司發布歷史和即時市場數據；開發並獲得納斯達克品牌指數和金融產品的許可；為上市和私營公司及組織提供投資者關係情報、治理解決方案和可持續發展解決方案產品，以及見解和工作流程解決方案；並運營上市平台。它還提供 Verafin，一個基於雲端的平台，用於檢測、調查和報告洗錢和金融詐欺行為； AxiomSL，風險數據管理和監管報告解決方案；支援雲端和本地監控解決方案，以協助遵守市場規則、法規和內部市場監控政策； Calypso，一個提供跨資產、前後交易、資金、風險和抵押品管理解決方案的平台；交易管理和託管服務，並處理包括現金股票、股票衍生品、貨幣、各種有息證券、商品、能源產品和數位貨幣在內的資產。此外，公司還提供股權衍生性商品交易和清算、現金股權交易和固定收益、流動性","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"財務數據和證券交易所","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":94.16,"h":94.31,"l":92.73,"c":92.86,"v":4971200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":93.0,"h":93.17,"l":92.43,"c":92.54,"v":5223800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":92.8,"h":94.05,"l":92.55,"c":93.1,"v":3168500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":93.25,"h":93.89,"l":88.63,"c":88.87,"v":9834700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":89.22,"h":89.93,"l":88.67,"c":89.57,"v":13438500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":89.53,"h":90.43,"l":89.25,"c":89.93,"v":4242800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":89.71,"h":89.92,"l":87.52,"c":88.44,"v":4622300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":88.43,"h":89.13,"l":87.05,"c":87.15,"v":4254600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":86.72,"h":87.67,"l":86.47,"c":86.73,"v":2799100},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":87.07,"h":87.6,"l":86.9,"c":87.51,"v":2432400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":87.8,"h":89.28,"l":87.2,"c":88.71,"v":3887500},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":88.65,"h":89.04,"l":87.96,"c":88.45,"v":4222400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":88.22,"h":88.47,"l":86.7,"c":86.91,"v":5350600},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":86.83,"h":87.43,"l":86.45,"c":87.34,"v":3067900},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":87.11,"h":88.16,"l":87.06,"c":87.61,"v":3625900},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":87.86,"h":88.36,"l":87.5,"c":88.17,"v":3519900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":88.61,"h":88.74,"l":87.54,"c":88.44,"v":2504500},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":89.14,"h":90.06,"l":87.64,"c":89.87,"v":3688700},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":90.43,"h":91